# Episode 5 — Node 04 — Parse AI Score

## Node Info
```
Node Type: Code Node
Node Name: 04 - Parse AI Score
Language : JavaScript
Mode     : Run Once for All Items
কাজ     : AI-এর text থেকে score, grade, reason বের করে
```

## কীভাবে বানালাম
```
Node 03-এর ডানে "+"
Search  : Code
Select করলাম
Rename  : 04 - Parse AI Score
Language: JavaScript
Mode    : Run Once for All Items
```

## Code
```javascript
const items = $input.all();
const results = [];

for (const item of items) {
  // AI response text নাও
  const rawText = item.json.output[0].content[0].text;

  // JSON parse করো
  const parsed = JSON.parse(rawText);

  // সব data একসাথে রাখো
  results.push({
    json: {
      name      : $('02 - Extract Lead Data').item.json.name,
      email     : $('02 - Extract Lead Data').item.json.email,
      phone     : $('02 - Extract Lead Data').item.json.phone,
      business  : $('02 - Extract Lead Data').item.json.business,
      budget    : $('02 - Extract Lead Data').item.json.budget,
      start_time: $('02 - Extract Lead Data').item.json.start_time,
      experience: $('02 - Extract Lead Data').item.json.experience,
      score     : Number(parsed.score),
      grade     : parsed.grade,
      reason    : parsed.reason
    }
  });
}

return results;
```

## Test Output
```
